{"success":true,"site":"tmdb","sid":"movie/20453","tmdb_id":20453,"title":"三傻大闹宝莱坞","original_title":"3 Idiots","overview":"本片根据印度畅销书作家奇坦·巴哈特（Chetan Bhagat）的处女作小说《五点人》（Five Point Someone）改编而成。法兰、拉杜与兰乔是皇家工程学院的学生，三人共居一室，结为好友。在以严格著称的学院里，兰乔是个非常与众不同的学生，他不死记硬背，甚至还公然顶撞校长“病毒”，质疑他的教学方法。他不仅鼓动法兰与拉杜去勇敢追寻理想，还劝说校长的二女儿碧雅离开满眼铜臭的未婚夫。兰乔的特立独行引起了模范学生“消音器”的不满，他约定十年后再与兰乔一决高下，看哪种生活方式更能取得成功。本片获孟买电影博览奖最佳影片、最佳导演、最佳配角（波曼·伊拉尼）、最佳剧本等六项大奖，并获国际印度电影协会最佳影片、最佳导演、最佳剧情、最佳摄影等十六项大奖。","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3Kdkci7FE36fWcsuoeGFYApBBE1.jpg","backdrop":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8gT3UKtglLVpu0YfccwbmXZ5Eis.jpg","release_date":"2009-12-23","year":"2009","runtime":"171 minutes","tmdb_rating_average":7.998,"tmdb_votes":2701,"tmdb_rating":"7.998 / 10 from 2701 users","genres":["剧情","喜剧"],"languages":["Hindi","English"],"countries":["India"],"production_companies":["Vidhu Vinod Chopra Productions","Vinod Chopra Films"],"directors":[{"name":"拉吉库马尔·希拉尼","id":85675}],"producers":[{"name":"维德胡·维诺德·乔普拉","id":99710}],"cast":[{"id":52763,"name":"阿米尔·汗","original_name":"Aamir Khan","character":"Ranchoddas \"Rancho\" Chanchad","image":"https://media.themoviedb.org/t/p/w300_and_h450_bestv2/6uiZSwi2kvd1jZ7X7Xz9W9VGuV4.jpg"},{"id":85519,"name":"马达范 R","original_name":"R. Madhavan","character":"Farhan Qureshi","image":"https://media.themoviedb.org/t/p/w300_and_h450_bestv2/gaDrAdXxIrbBRCd9cX8YvJDEuLb.jpg"},{"id":53674,"name":"沙尔曼·乔什","original_name":"Sharman Joshi","character":"Raju Rastogi","image":"https://media.themoviedb.org/t/p/w300_and_h450_bestv2/mQr8ynFFVq08qgQ4aSNl5B0ko8v.jpg"},{"id":37233,"name":"卡琳娜·卡普","original_name":"करीना कपूर खान","character":"Pia Sahastrabudhhe","image":"https://media.themoviedb.org/t/p/w300_and_h450_bestv2/pJZJJ93NwJq3kb3RWtaZBYVga1x.jpg"},{"id":35779,"name":"博曼·伊拉尼","original_name":"Boman Irani","character":"Viru \"Virus\" Sahastrabudhhe","image":"https://media.themoviedb.org/t/p/w300_and_h450_bestv2/5J7GiiNar9bg9rGYeA2L30JXE2W.jpg"},{"id":169201,"name":"奥米·瓦依达","o